            >
              <div
                class="bg-center bg-no-repeat aspect-square bg-cover rounded-full h-12 w-12 shrink-0 opacity-80"
                data-alt="Portrait of an Indian woman"
                style="
                  background-image: url(&quot;https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuB3mlI1a5k6LvCkKjXntvwhg08Ax31KixejwSQM_Whao08WIQpauwPJ3D4OzkPYZgVBNMDJ1N7kgJqSfb_TR1cVpFLSwPBiOPySypGovAkCujQ8ILp_RXj2kW9RapkVYXW81FjjbUZcHwRmxTZ7Ppn2dVkHh5C_shDQVJtjziT6If9-rlcrmMsO6ZbjZhKaNe9Bp7Jbv7bNOZB7AbPpgDhVqmVfSVBzvMgs14SPhYWGIn6HIW5ErrPTNv1DQA4aFw6KKBv69zfZ4H2p&quot;);
                "
